Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libcups2-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wildos-captdriver
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups
Description: Driver for Canon CAPT laser printers (LBP2900, LBP3000 and others)
 captdriver, the free driver for Canon laser printers that only speak
 Canon's CAPT protocol: the LBP2900 and LBP3000, and the LBP3010, 3018,
 3050, 3100, 3108, 3150, 6000 and 6018 through the LBP3010 driver. Not in
 the Wild OS image: printer-driver installs it when one of these printers
 is plugged in.
